    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "card": "primary",
    "summary": "When a friendly unit **destroys** another unit, the friendly unit gains **consecration**. As your turn finishes, you may choose one **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** in range of each of your units with that status, skipping your **home objective** and any already **consecrated**. The choice consecrates it, spends the unit’s status and puts an operation marker of yours in range of the selected objective.",
